From ef987ec72679db69f1048db8889c82d6bf4dce0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefano Castagnetta <scastagnetta@nvidia.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 17:30:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Lint/typing fixes for v0.22.0 b12x carryover

Pre-commit over the replayed b12x patches on v0.22.0:
- ruff format reflow of VLLM_FP8_MOE_BACKEND choices, the FP8 backend
  error `src`, and the Qwen3.5 MTP expert-ignore append
- ruff: drop the duplicate `ParallelLMHead` import in modelopt.py and
  collapse `_supports_quant_scheme` to return its condition (SIM103)
- mypy: annotate `FlashInferB12xExperts._wrapper` as
  `B12xMoEWrapper | None` (TYPE_CHECKING import) and assert non-None
  after `_ensure_wrapper()` so `.run()` type-checks

Signed-off-by: Stefano Castagnetta <scastagnetta@nvidia.com>
---
 vllm/envs.py                                       | 11 +++++++++--
 .../fused_moe/experts/flashinfer_b12x_moe.py       | 14 +++++++++-----
 vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/oracle/fp8.py |  5 +++--
 .../model_executor/layers/quantization/modelopt.py |  1 -
 vllm/model_executor/models/qwen3_5_mtp.py          |  4 +---
 5 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

